      "action": "请检查订单状态",
      "sub_code": "isv.business-failed:1005",
      "sub_msg": "订单状态不支持当前行为，请刷新后重试"
    },
    {
      "code": "50002",
      "meaning": "业务处理失败 / 推送的物流状态不对，请查证后重试, 当前状态是 跨境履约单创建成功（sub_code: isv.business-failed:1004）",
      "action": "请检查物流状态",
      "sub_code": "isv.business-failed:1004",
      "sub_msg": "推送的物流状态不对，请查证后重试, 当前状态是 跨境履约单创建成功"
    },
    {
      "code": "50002",
      "meaning": "业务处理失败 / 请求太频繁（sub_code: isv.business-failed:1002）",
      "action": "请稍后重试",
      "sub_code": "isv.business-failed:1002",
      "sub_msg": "请求太频繁"
    },
    {
      "code": "50002",
      "meaning": "业务处理失败 / 1006:record not found（sub_code: isv.business-failed:1006）",
      "action": "请检查后重试",
      "sub_code": "isv.business-failed:1006",
      "sub_msg": "1006:record not found"
    }
  ],
  "examples": {
    "request": "curl -X GET 'https://openapi-fxg.jinritemai.com/crossBorder/orderConfirm?app_key=your_appkey_here&method=crossBorder.orderConfirm&access_token=your_accesstoken_here&param_json={}&timestamp=2018-06-19%2016:06:59&v=2&sign=your_sign_here'",
    "responseSuccess": {
      "code": 10000,
      "msg": "success",
      "sub_code": "",
      "sub_msg": ""
    },
    "responseError": {
      "code": 50002,
